      387.6,
      308.41,
      445.67
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition(Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intendsto acquire the following lands which are required for a publicpurpose.",
